{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is approached then take it, in order to check it. Move to it if visible. Finally, scan area for objects.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    />\"",
